{"id":"n85902-1-15","stage":4,"title":"항아리 · 罐","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85902-1-15-1","ko":"전통 양조장에 항아리가 참 많네요?","zh":"传统酿酒厂里的陶罐真多啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"전통","meaning":"传统","explanation":"전통：传统。","readings":[{"term":"전통","audio":"/audio/c4b267a6b5c6a012a989.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70841","senseId":"1","lemma":"전통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전통","audio":"/audio/c4b267a6b5c6a012a989.mp3"}},{"text":"양조장에","meaning":"酿造厂、酒厂","explanation":"양조장：酿造厂、酒厂；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"양조장","audio":"/audio/457617f618cf8f20d43b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:양조장:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"양조장","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양조장에","audio":"/audio/2899953dbec9d1dee840.mp3"}},{"text":"항아리가","meaning":"罐，缸，坛子","explanation":"항아리：罐，缸，坛子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"항아리","audio":"/audio/9fac85098277be9a84db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85902","senseId":"1","lemma":"항아리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항아리가","audio":"/audio/1561b0510b9e13a89706.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确。","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"많네요?","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많네요","audio":"/audio/5479912738bb2f404d05.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c4b267a6b5c6a012","term":"전통","zh":"传统","audio":"/audio/c4b267a6b5c6a012a989.mp3","entryId":"70841","definition":"某集团或共同体中，从上一时代开始传下来的固有的思想、习惯、行为等样式。","pronunciation":["전통"]},{"id":"457617f618cf8f20","term":"양조장","zh":"酿造厂、酒厂","audio":"/audio/457617f618cf8f20d43b.mp3","definition":"酿制酒类等的场所。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9fac85098277be9a","term":"항아리","zh":"罐，缸，坛子","audio":"/audio/9fac85098277be9a84db.mp3","entryId":"85902","definition":"用泥土烤制而成的，底部及上口较小、中部呈圆筒状的器具。","pronunciation":["항아리"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a4fb934a433866de3ad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85902-1-15-2","ko":"네, 이 항아리들에 잘 익은 술이 가득 담겨 있지요.","zh":"是的，这些陶罐里都装满了酿得醇厚的酒呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"항아리들에","meaning":"罐，缸，坛子","explanation":"항아리：罐，缸，坛子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"항아리","audio":"/audio/9fac85098277be9a84db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85902","senseId":"1","lemma":"항아리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항아리들에","audio":"/audio/19d9a25f4e90f1863470.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"익은","meaning":"熟，发酵","explanation":"익다：熟，发酵；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"익다","audio":"/audio/615092c47f4ab18c0d1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63510","senseId":"3","lemma":"익다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"익은","audio":"/audio/07cd9f4f8e94c8f65480.mp3"}},{"text":"술이","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술이","audio":"/audio/85bd8ad79fb44e88874e.mp3"}},{"text":"가득","meaning":"挤满，装满，充满","explanation":"가득：挤满，装满，充满。","readings":[{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62661","senseId":"2","lemma":"가득","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가득","audio":"/audio/260476e01310cd163341.mp3"}},{"text":"담겨","meaning":"被装，被盛","explanation":"담기다：被装，被盛；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"담기다","audio":"/audio/486c8400893690b15fec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66323","senseId":"1","lemma":"담기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담겨","audio":"/audio/92a0cb28967fd9121dc9.mp3"}},{"text":"있지요.","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있지요","audio":"/audio/10784488a971c4872cf6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，是的，哎","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于回应长辈的呼叫。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687"